// Plan 032 PR28: one initialized Better Auth instance per isolate for the
// request-independent lanes — the auth middleware's session / api-key / JWKS
// reads and the JWT keyring (src/lib/jwt.ts). Building an instance runs every
// plugin's init, including the oauth-provider's resource seed (a read and, in
// 'merge' mode, a write per resource): ~150 ms of database round trips that
// every cookie request used to pay. The instance is built from the env alone
// (no cf / executionCtx): these lanes send no email and schedule no work.
// Every request's env carries the same bindings (the JWT verifier relies on
// the same fact), so the first one serves the isolate.
//
// Only an instance whose initialization has COMPLETED is shared: a request
// never awaits another request's pending initialization (an I/O promise that
// request owns, which Workers may cancel with it). Concurrent first requests
// each build their own; a failed initialization is simply never shared.
